{"src":"en","tgt":"it","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"it","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7705.440089,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":8889.736705,"text":"Se avete visto il film National Treasure, potreste pensare che una mappa del tesoro fosse stata scritta sul retro della Dichiarazione d’Indipendenza."},{"kind":"audio","t":8987.897713,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8992.863256999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":8995.768596,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8997.181372,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":8998.41777,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9000.071302,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9000.813219,"samples":19992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":13872.037359,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":14952.049813,"text":"Il cioccolato caldo è all’altezza degli standard belgi. I succhi di frutta sono costosi, ma dopo un po’ riuscirete a apprezzarne la dolcezza."},{"kind":"audio","t":15040.929852,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15045.735598000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15049.531012999998,"samples":26864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"audio","t":15141.36733,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15146.277544999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15152.297520999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15156.293881,"samples":29496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":22205.817903000003,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":23208.203973,"text":"Tuttavia, questo non è vero. Anche se c’è qualcosa scritto sul retro del documento, non si tratta di una mappa del tesoro."},{"kind":"audio","t":23294.770402000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23297.972426,"samples":25432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"audio","t":23377.298141000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23382.720097,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23388.036775,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23393.331733000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":23394.111350000003,"samples":9928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":29973.328785,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":31047.150837,"text":"Potresti anche voler consultare i consigli di governi diversi dal tuo, ma i loro consigli sono pensati per i loro cittadini."},{"kind":"audio","t":31148.645277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31153.769588000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31159.243833000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31164.520722000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31169.710062000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31172.874036999998,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":41280.621643,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42408.325391,"text":"L’Isola di Hong Kong dà il nome al territorio di Hong Kong ed è un luogo che molti turisti considerano il punto focale principale."},{"kind":"audio","t":42504.547262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42509.662564,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42514.896072999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42520.169511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42525.4459,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42530.250246999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"audio","t":42530.60871,"samples":192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":49089.240413,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":50418.593964,"text":"Chi intende guidare in zone tropicali calde o attraverso passi montuosi dovrebbe prendere in considerazione la possibilità di neve, ghiaccio o terreni scivolosi."},{"kind":"audio","t":50521.580249,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50526.791868,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50531.977758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50537.149479,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":50542.745291,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50547.672935999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":50553.437035999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":50553.866648999996,"samples":13024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":58772.613557,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":59661.764150999996,"text":"La segregazione e la ricombinazione fanno oscillare la variazione avanti e indietro tra i due gruppi."},{"kind":"audio","t":59751.524825,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59752.764713,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59754.213317999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59756.182234,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59756.682544999996,"samples":20728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":310},{"kind":"input","t":61178.331426,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61408.765309999995,"text":"con ogni generazione."},{"kind":"audio","t":61499.148992999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61501.556012,"samples":20032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":66504.49023699999,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67430.06309899999,"text":"Il termine “insetto” viene utilizzato dagli entomologi in senso formale per indicare questo gruppo di insetti."},{"kind":"audio","t":67530.718283,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67535.822745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67541.056434,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67546.271834,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67551.966805,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":930},{"kind":"audio","t":67552.353028,"samples":2960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":74687.253969,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":75814.56054399999,"text":"Innanzitutto, la maggior parte dei cavalieri indossa stivali da equitazione con tacco e suola liscia e piuttosto stretta."},{"kind":"audio","t":75916.453047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75921.506689,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75926.856407,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75932.689655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75938.07107199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":75940.14281599999,"samples":18560,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":83903.967345,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":84745.532624,"text":"La commissione fu la risposta di Martelli alle ampie proteste anti-regime iniziate a ottobre."},{"kind":"audio","t":84832.785751,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84837.906592,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84843.19883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84848.38948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":84849.22431599999,"samples":11128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":91127.558668,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":92043.629755,"text":"I vigili del fuoco sono riusciti a spegnere l’incendio verso le 23:35."},{"kind":"audio","t":92132.73025,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92138.750086,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92143.941366,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92149.342462,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":92149.51482899999,"samples":5728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":97359.919368,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98285.387842,"text":"La tempesta di intensa attività della stagione degli uragani atlantici, la tempesta subtropicale Jerry,"},{"kind":"audio","t":98376.699819,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98381.79925,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98387.03454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":98392.18605,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":98396.979197,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":98397.125775,"samples":560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":100221.78315799999,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100717.21816799999,"text":"Si è formata nell’Oceano Atlantico oggi."},{"kind":"audio","t":100798.140095,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100803.184687,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":100803.667799,"samples":11264,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":107228.57045,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":107946.215297,"text":"Ci ha portato a addestrare l’auto e molti altri mezzi di trasporto."},{"kind":"audio","t":108045.186641,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108050.384891,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108055.975564,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":108056.42354599999,"samples":10296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116604.699821,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117671.197019,"text":"È famosa per essere un epicentro del lusso, nato intorno al 400 d.C. e durato per molto tempo."},{"kind":"audio","t":117769.926308,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117774.99341,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117780.202679,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":117785.541957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117790.328624,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"input","t":120741.24672899999,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121246.697465,"text":"fino a circa l’anno 1100 d.C."},{"kind":"audio","t":121335.53541499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121340.820653,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":121341.166567,"samples":6464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":127057.79912899999,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127622.657675,"text":"La superficie della Luna è composta da rocce e polvere. Lo strato esterno della Luna è chiamato crosta."},{"kind":"audio","t":127714.175779,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127719.097943,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127723.164733,"samples":27464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"audio","t":127800.859346,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127805.676612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127807.53646,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":134203.23680800002,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135504.164311,"text":"Il Corpo degli ingegneri degli Stati Uniti ha stimato che sei pollici di pioggia potrebbero causare danni ulteriori alle aree già danneggiate."},{"kind":"audio","t":135608.88657600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135614.494738,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135619.526041,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135624.92857800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135630.231686,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135635.484445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":135636.53682600003,"samples":11592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":141173.598062,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":142138.72673800003,"text":"In particolare, si sostiene che sia possibile rilevare se una persona sta mentendo interpretando correttamente le microespressioni."},{"kind":"audio","t":142242.45089900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142247.68958900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142252.944797,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142258.192226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142263.632462,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142268.052625,"samples":31160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":147227.010054,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":147935.89635300002,"text":"Non danneggiate il sito lasciando segni o graffi con scritte sui materiali."},{"kind":"audio","t":148032.926611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148038.086291,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":148043.40569900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148045.569332,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":154863.94520100002,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":156123.85073600002,"text":"Il ruggito della tigre non è simile al ruggito potente del leone, ma assomiglia più a una sequenza di parole ringhiose e urlate."},{"kind":"audio","t":156221.88000600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156226.85077000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156232.09848900003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156237.37834700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156242.934791,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156246.194415,"samples":22760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":161902.970654,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":162972.01678900002,"text":"Le ricerche del XX secolo hanno dimostrato che esistono due gruppi di variazione genetica: uno nascosto e uno espresso."},{"kind":"audio","t":163062.68229700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163067.80620800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":163073.01942700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163078.32959500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":163080.238652,"samples":17728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"audio","t":163158.32090800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163162.079613,"samples":27232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"close","t":173204.00935100002,"code":1005}]}